## SOFT CELL - TAINTED LOVE
#  Full Arrangement Cover for PULP / SKRED. 144 BPM, G minor, 105 bars (~2:55).
#  Written by Ed Cobb (1964), Produced by Mike Thorne, Performed by Soft Cell (1981).
#  Self-contained: drums from built-in waves 82-99, Synare S3X bink-bink,
#  Korg Synthe-Bass, Synclavier II brass and bells, Marc Almond vocal lead.
#  Zero synthetic noise risers - dynamic builds driven by authentic 1981 synthpop.
#  Load:   [tainted_love.sk] /ls
#  Start:  play        Stop:  stop
#
#  VOICE MAP (all labeled via [name] vt):
#    v0  four-on-the-floor kick (w82) + v5 sub punch (w0)
#    v1  CR-78 crisp gated snare (w83) + v4 electronic clap (w86)
#    v2  closed hat 8ths/16ths (w84)  v3  open hat offbeat (w85)
#    v17 crash cymbal (w94)  v18 hi tom (w90)  v19 mid tom (w91)
#    v11 Synare S3X 'bink-bink' lead (w10) + v12 ring (w11) -> Bus 1 DL4 delay
#    v6  Korg Synthe-Bass saw (w1) + v7 sub pulse (w2)
#    v21 Synclavier brass root (w15)  v22 3rd (w15)  v23 5th (w16) -> Bus 3
#    v15 Synclavier bell lead (w10) + v16 chime (w10)
#    v8  Marc Almond vocal lead (w15) + v9 (w15 left), v10 (w16 right) -> Bus 2
#    v13 Marc Almond backing vocal (w15) + v14 (w16 right)
#
#  DELAY BUSES:
#    Bus 1: Delta Labs DL4 digital slapback / ping-pong for Synare bink-bink (16th)
#    Bus 2: Marc Almond vocal hall space echo (dotted eighth, 144 BPM)
#    Bus 3: Synclavier brass stabs & bell reverb wash (quarter note)
#    Bus 4: Snare & electronic clap gated room tail (eighth note)
#
#  ARRANGEMENT (105 bars):
#    0-3   Intro: Solo Synare S3X 'bink-bink' ping-pong delay hook
#    4-7   Korg Synthe-Bass enters with closed hats and bink-bink
#    8-23  Verse 1: Full groove, kick, snare, brass stabs, Marc's vocal
#    24-35 Chorus 1: G-major lift, 'Once I ran to you...', D-major tension
#    36-39 Interlude: Riff vamp + Synclavier bell hook ('Tainted love!')
#    40-55 Verse 2: 'Now I know I've got to run away...', full driving beat
#    56-67 Chorus 2: High vocal passion, bell arpeggios, dominant turnaround
#    68-79 Bridge: Drums drop to kick pulse, tense breakdown ('Don't touch me...')
#    80-91 Chorus 3: Climax wall of sound, full emotional release
#    92-103 Outro Vamp: Extended club groove, Marc's ad-libs, cascading bells
#    104   Hard cold end on beat 1, solo bink-bink delay tail into silence
# ======================================================================

[TAINTED LOVE - SOFT CELL] puts
M 144 16

## DELAY BUSES
# Bus 1: Delta Labs DL4 digital slapback / ping-pong for Synare Bink-Bink (16th note)
DS 1 144 .25
DL 1 - - 4 0 0 8
DD 1 7 2
DP 1 1

# Bus 2: Marc Almond vocal hall space echo (dotted eighth)
DS 2 144 .75
DL 2 - - 8 2 3 11
DD 2 6 3
DP 2 1

# Bus 3: Synclavier brass stabs & bell reverb wash (quarter note)
DS 3 144 1
DL 3 - - 10 3 6 12
DD 3 7 3

# Bus 4: Snare & electronic clap gated room tail (eighth note)
DS 4 144 .5
DL 4 - - 6 0 0 8
DD 4 5 4

## VOICES
# Drums: Roland CR-78 style punchy kick + sub
v0 w82 f440 a7 p0 [kick electronic] vt
v5 w0 a-2 p0 t.001,.20,0,.05 j1 k180 q.7 [kick sub punch] vt

# Crisp snare, claps, hats, crash, toms
v1 w83 f440 a8 p0 r3 ds.25 [snare cr78 gated] vt
v2 w84 f440 a-3 p.25 [closed hat] vt
v3 w85 f440 a-2 p-.25 [open hat] vt
v4 w86 f440 a7 p0 ds.20 [electronic clap] vt
v17 w94 f440 a4 p.2 [crash cymbal] vt
v18 w90 f480 a6 p-.3 [electronic hi tom] vt
v19 w91 f380 a6 p.3 [electronic mid tom] vt

# The Iconic Synare S3X 'Bink-Bink' (v11 lead + v12 stereo ring)
# Highly resonant FM/ping with pitch envelope, feeding Bus 1 ping-pong delay
v11 w10 a4 p-.2 t.001,.09,0,.03 j1 k3800 q4.5 r1 ds.40 [synare bink lead] vt
v11 >12
v12 w11 a1 N0,7 p.25 r0 ds.35 [synare bink ring] vt
v11 G12 H12

# Dave Ball's Korg Synthe-Bass (v6 saw center + v7 sub pulse right)
v6 w1 a2 p-.1 t.002,.18,0,.04 j1 k1400 q2.8 r2 ds.08 [korg bass saw] vt
v6 >7
v7 w2 a-3 N0,8 p.35 r0 [korg bass sub pulse] vt
v6 G7 H7

# Mike Thorne's NED Synclavier II Digital Brass Triad (v21 root, v22 3rd, v23 5th)
v21 w15 a-4 p-.35 t.005,.22,0,.06 j1 k2600 q1.8 ds.20 [synclavier brass root] vt
v22 w15 a-5 p0 t.005,.22,0,.06 j1 k2600 q1.8 ds.20 [synclavier brass 3rd] vt
v23 w16 a-5 p.35 t.005,.22,0,.06 j1 k2800 q1.8 ds.20 [synclavier brass 5th] vt

# Synclavier Crystalline Bell Chimes & Arpeggio (v15 center + v16 stereo right)
v15 w10 a-3 p-.25 t.002,.45,0,.15 j1 k4200 q3.0 ds.35 [synclavier bell lead] vt
v15 >16
v16 w10 a-6 N0,12 p.4 r0 ds.30 [synclavier bell chime] vt
v15 G16 H16

# Marc Almond Vocal Lead: expressive, theatrical, soulful singing synth
# Portamento glide P18, smooth attack, vibrato, zero-hanging decay
v8 w15 a-3 p0 t.03,1.4,0,.25 j1 k2800 q1.2 g.08 c4,.25 r1 ds.35 P18 [marc almond lead] vt
v8 >9
v8 >10
v9 w15 a-6 N0,8 p-.45 r0 [marc vocal left] vt
v10 w16 a-7 N0,-8 p.45 r0 [marc vocal right] vt
v8 G9,10 H9,10

# Marc Almond Backing Vocal / Echo Shouts (v13 lead + v14 right)
v13 w15 a-5 p-.3 t.02,.9,0,.15 j1 k3200 q1.5 ds.30 P12 [marc backing shout] vt
v13 >14
v14 w16 a-7 N0,12 p.3 r0 ds.25 [marc backing right] vt
v13 G14 H14

